WEBVTT

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.420
Have you...

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:12.650
ever fallen...

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.510
in love?

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:59.550
The Beauty A and the Beast Z

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.810
Ah, that was refreshing!

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:06.230
Even though we were in the middle of class, you were fast asleep.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.270
It's easier to doze off because of class!

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:10.520
I even had a dream today!

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:11.690
What kind of dream?

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:12.900
A love confession!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:13.360
Huh?

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.690
Someone confessed to me, and even asked for my hand in marriage!

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:18.820
Plus, he was kneeling!

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:22.450
Kneeling? What era are you from?

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:27.120
And then, when I said yes, he carried me like a princess!

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:30.210
Oh, I was so happy!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:36.760
I want Onii-chan to tell me he likes me, and then carry me like a princess too!

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:40.010
There it is. Koyoi's "Onii-chan~!"

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.640
Can you do something about that brother complex of yours?

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:47.060
Doba-chan and Kei-chan, wouldn't you want the person you like to tell you that they like you?

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:47.930
Not really.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:52.560
I mean, it's fine if the one confessing is a guy you like or someone that's your type,

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:56.360
but if it's someone that you don't even like, then it's just a nuisance.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.740
Kei-chan, you're popular amongst the guys after all.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.240
Huh? So what?

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.160
Are you saying you'd still be happy if a guy you didn't like confessed to you?

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:06.870
It's more like the actual experience of being confessed to.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:07.910
Exactly!

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:12.130
Even if it's just once, I want to experience a confession of love!

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:25.180
Yes, I've been dreaming about being confessed to this way for so long!

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:29.270
To be loved by that one and only person!

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:34.150
If that happened, I'd go out with him right then and there!

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.190
Right then and there? No way!

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.360
There are more important qualities, aren't there?

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.780
Important qualities?

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:40.950
His looks!

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.610
Enomoto, you choose your men based on how they look?

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.120
Of course! Their looks are very important!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:51.830
But they say it's better to be loved than... to... love...

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.590
W-W-What?!

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:07.760
It's wearing a high school uniform, but is it really a demon reborn into the 21st century?!

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.600
W-What do we do?! He keeps looking over here!

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.060
H-Help...

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.230
We need to get out of here quickly before something happens!

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:15.190
Nao, you okay?

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.650
What? What's he taking out?!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.580
Stop! Have mercy!

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.620
Huh? Nothing's happening...

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.120
Did he go somewhere?

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.000
A letter?

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.350
Ayumi-chan, what's that?

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.060
A challenge for a fight?

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:53.020
Don't say such terrible things!

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:57.980
Arihara Ayumi-sama, I like you! Please go out with me! Zaitsu Misao

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.990
Y-You can give me an answer later.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.410
It talked...

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:21.340
Isn't that great, Ayumi? You got your confession of love!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:25.220
Just look at this letter! He wrote it with such cute handwriting!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.590
It says "Zaitsu Misao!" Even his name is cute!

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.980
This isn't funny!

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:37.730
Come on, hurry and get up so you can chase after him to give him the okay!

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:40.310
You said that if you were ever confessed to, you would date them right then and there, right?

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:44.990
Stop seeing it so objectively! I'd rather die than date a monster like that!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:48.740
I'm telling you, that's why looks are important.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:53.330
It must suck to be confessed to by a beast like that!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.700
I'm telling you, I'm turning him down!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.080
But is it really okay to do that?

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.000
Huh?

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.880
If you turn him down, who knows what he'll do.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:05.800
True...

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:09.640
It'll be fine! He said you can give him an answer later, right?

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.260
A-Anyway, let's go home.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.260
Ayumi-chan?

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.350
Ayumi...

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.600
Are you... crying?

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:22.270
Well, it's obvious she'd want to cry. Her first confession ever was from a monster like that, after all.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:23.110
No...

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:24.480
Then what?

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.780
I'm still too surprised, I can't stand up.

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:30.570
I'm home.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.950
What exactly am I supposed to do?

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:38.750
The suspect became angry after he was turned down by the female victim...

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.500
What do I do? If I turn him down...

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:43.130
He would...

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.090
Hey, don't just stare at the TV.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:45.590
Yeah...

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.260
With his physique...

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:50.760
Man, what a scary world it's become.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:50.760
I would...

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:52.300
Ayumi, you should be careful.
В

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.010
Probably...

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.020
It's absolutely impossible!

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:57.890
Huh?

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.020
Thank you for the meal.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:01.560
You've hardly eaten anything!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.980
Are you feeling sick or something, Ayumi?

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.070
I'm doomed...

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.280
Should I use it for tomorrow's lunch?

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.880
No matter which one I choose, my future's bleak!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.130
Ugh!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.710
What am I supposed to do?!

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:33.010
Maybe I should just give it a shot and go on a date with him?

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:37.140
If IвЂ™m his girlfriend, he might treasure me.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.100
But will I be able to endure it?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:42.480
Those large, bear-like hands...

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.440
That mouth as big as a shark's...

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:51.200
I'll be a beautiful maiden at its mercy, forced to do this and that!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.530
What am I thinking?!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.040
I...

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.830
Hey, Ayumi.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.500
Don't surprise me like-

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.250
Which one of us is surprised?!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:09.050
Don't come into your teenage sister's room without knocking!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.130
My bad.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:14.430
I was just worried because you didn't eat anything at dinner.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.350
Worried?

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:19.810
That's right! You might be able to help me solve my problem, Onii-chan!

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:24.150
Hey, Onii-chan? Ayumi has a favor to ask of you!

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:27.940
When you ask me like that I just can't say no, can I?

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:28.980
Well, what is it?

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:31.780
If you're bothered by something, just tell your big brother!

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:36.320
Well, there's someone I want you to beat up!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.660
Beat up?

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:40.240
Did this guy do something to you, Ayumi?

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.040
No, not yet.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:47.040
But he might in the future...

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:51.260
Damn it! Who the hell dares to lay a finger on my adorable Ayumi?!

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:54.550
Leave it to me! I'll leave him black and blue!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.340
So, what's his name?

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:57.600
Some guy from your class?

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.770
No, a high school student. Zaitsu Misao.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:05.270
Zaitsu Misao?!

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:09.070
I think his uniform was probably from Kurobone high school.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:10.940
Onii-chan?!

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:14.030
You should not speak of that name.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.610
Huh?! Why not?!

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:16.950
What about beating him up?!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:20.240
Dumbass! Do you care about your brother's life at all?!

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.290
What was that?!

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.460
Are you saying that you don't care what happens to me?

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.000
Onii-chan, you wimp!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.340
I mean, I didn't expect him to win in the first place, but...

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.800
If that's how it's going to be, I'll just have to...

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:32.840
...sleep!

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:39.220
In the morning, everything was like a dream.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.140
I'm leaving!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:44.980
I couldn't believe it.

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:51.270
Why?

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.030
Look.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:00.780
Will she be okay?

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:01.700
That's terrible!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.960
And the nightmare continued even after that.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:19.680
Onii-chan, save me!

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:20.720
Why?!

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:21.390
Even on the way home?

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:35.030
Give me a break!

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:46.330
Beast-kun doesn't have a problem doing this day after day, does he?

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.250
How many days has it been?

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.460
A week.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:52.000
Thanks to him, I'm completely stressed out.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.800
He even follows me in my dreams...

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:57.590
At this rate, I'm going to die of sleep deprivation.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.510
Sounds terrible, Ayumi-chan.

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.970
It's because you've held off on giving him a reply!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:07.220
But I have no idea what he'll do to me if I turn him down...

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.890
Just go out with him then!

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:12.690
That way, you'll be the first one out of all of us to have a boyfriend!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.270
I'm jealous!

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:19.070
Kei-chan, you should go out with him instead of me then!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.610
Think of it as helping me!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.660
I'd love to help you and all, but...

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:27.410
Remember? I focus on looks!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:28.200
You called for me?

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.290
Why would anyone call for you, kappa face!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.210
Your face is already a joke as it is!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.250
Right? Ayu-

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.130
Ayumi-chan?

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.170
I can't go on.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.510
I think I used up the last of my energy screaming just now.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:43.760
If you're not feeling well, I can take you to the nurse's office.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.890
That's right.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.850
Come on, Ayumi. Get up and go see the nurse.

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:50.020
Impossible...

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.890
I can't move...

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:52.980
I guess there's no helping it.

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.950
W-W-What are you doing to me?!

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:07.830
What's going on?

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.290
Arihara-san might fall if she keeps struggling.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:09.830
Are they a couple?

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.250
But...

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.790
I'm being carried like a princess...

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:17.540
What should I do? My heart's beating so fast!

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:21.840
I want to become a paramedic when I'm older.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.840
Is that so?

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:31.430
I've always dreamed of being loved by someone,

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:35.600
but this must be how a girl falls in love!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.360
A paramedic's wife, huh?

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:42.740
I want a son and a daughter.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:41.070
There you go, Arihara-san.

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:42.740
I'll head back to class then.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:47.620
Thanks a lot, Zaitsu-kun!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:49.660
Zaitsu?

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.080
Zaitsu?!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.040
Could he be...

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.500
Well, take care of yourself.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:57.880
Hold on! Zaitsu-kin, you wouldn't happen to have an older brother in high school, would you?

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.550
So you've heard of my brother too, Arihara-san?

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:08.010
I guess the name Zaitsu Misao is pretty well-known around here.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.010
Zaitsu...

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:08.720
Misao.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:10.930
A-Arihara-san?!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.100
It's a nightmare!

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.360
It must be a really bad nightmare.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.570
Arihara-san must be having quite a scary dream...

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.570
No...

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:32.830
If I end up marrying Zaitsu-kun, will that thing will follow me around for the rest of my life?!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.210
Even though our love would have just blossomed,

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:42.340
I'll never be able to escape his evil clutches!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:48.930
You know, there are rumors going around about you and Zaitsu-kun.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:51.310
What? Really?!

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:52.430
You're kidding!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:53.640
That's going to be a problem.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:56.100
Zaitsu-kun was quick to deny it though.

00:13:56.980 --> 00:14:01.150
But who would've thought that Beast-kun is Zaitsu-kun's older brother?

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:03.070
I had heard heard rumors about it, but...

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:05.190
They donвЂ™t look alike at all.

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:07.110
The mysteries of DNA.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.450
I know, right?

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:13.830
Zaitsu-kun is so nice, handsome, and reliable.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:17.080
Anyway, enough about Zaitsu-kun for now.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:20.540
More importantly, you have to do something about Beast-kun.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:25.090
That's right. You need to do it for the sake of Koyoi and Nao, who're too scared to walk home with us anymore.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.970
I guess I really do have to give him an answer.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.510
We wish you the best of luck!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:35.600
Fine...

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:41.860
I see now.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.860
IвЂ™m not the only one being bothered.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.280
Everyone else is bothered by it too.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.290
It'll be fine if I do this for the sake of my friends.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.540
I can definitely say it!

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:07.460
Um...

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:09.970
Huh?!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:15.220
Why?

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:26.320
Why did he have to start liking me?

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.490
It's really troublesome!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:31.820
Following me home everyday like this...

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:35.410
I'll give you an answer when I've collected my feelings,

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:38.160
so please, stop following me!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.000
What should I do? He's angry.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.710
Maybe I'm...

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:50.920
Anyway, that's all I wanted to say!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:53.470
Why?

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:57.100
Why is he in love with me?

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:04.810
He won't follow me all the way here, will he?

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:12.570
Well, I did tell him not to follow me...

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:15.820
Did I say too much?

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:21.290
Wait, why am I feeling guilty about this?

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:23.960
How stupid.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:24.880
Huh?

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.420
You're Misao's chick, aren't you?

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.390
Three male high school students.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:39.260
One is currently unconscious.

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:42.180
The patient's name is Zaitsu Misao.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.900
Can you hear me, Zaitsu-kun?

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:45.310
Zaitsu-kun!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:49.400
At that moment, I imagined it.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:55.030
Her smiling face...

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.160
AYUMI-CHAN!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.990
I-it's a miracle...

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:01.410
He regained consciousness!

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.000
That's why I wanted to tell her...

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:07.500
I don't know what will happen to me because I get into fights everyday.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.050
A bother, huh?

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:15.430
Hmm?

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:20.720
Hello?

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:34.610
There's no doubt. Misao's going to come barging in.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.570
Finally, the day we can beat the crap out of him has come.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.490
You're kidding me, right?

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:42.450
What's with this development?

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:46.790
And why am I always the one placed in these situations?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:51.630
There's something wrong with him, falling for some eighth grade brat.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.130
He has to be a perv deep down inside.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:57.720
So I was taken as bait to lure him out after all.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:01.390
But why did he let her walk home alone today?

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.220
Before, he would always take her home.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:07.810
Who knows? Maybe he needed to take a dump?

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:13.190
Why the hell would he go take a shit when he knows this girl's bait?

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:13.820
There's no way he'll come.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:14.900
Dumbass!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:15.820
Because I...

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:15.360
Stupid!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.450
Shut up!

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:20.370
Don't underestimate his surprise attacks!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:23.080
The pain we suffered when he one hit KO-ed all of us...

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:23.910
Don't you remember?!

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:25.450
He's not coming!

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.040
Huh?

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.460
He's definitely angry.

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:31.840
What? A lover's quarrel?

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:34.760
Hey, hey. There's no point if Misao doesn't come!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.630
There's no way he's going to come and rescue me!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:40.640
Because I told him something really terrible!

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:42.100
Hey, don't cry...

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.390
Misao still likes you.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:47.560
I'm sure he'll come rescue you, so don't cry.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:51.400
Amazing!

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.820
Mi-Misao!

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:59.740
I came like I said I would, so let her go.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.160
Untie...

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:05.240
A-A-A-A-Ayu-Ayu...

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.700
What the..?! Are you too embarrassed to even say her name?!

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:10.120
A pure heart doesn't match that face of yours-

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.210
Sorry I took so long.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:16.590
I didn't think you'd come.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:17.710
Why?

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:24.930
Okay, okay. Cut it out with the love-love scene.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:28.890
This is when the true purpose of the hostage is revealed.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:32.940
What are you doing?!

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:37.440
If you fight back I'll expose her precious parts completely!

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:41.320
I wouldn't want to do such terrible things to a middle schooler!

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:44.530
So shut up and take this!

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:48.450
Get him!

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:52.540
We're going to stop your flawless streak of victories!

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:58.170
If I hadn't been caught, he would definitely win.

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:02.550
If I hadn't told him he was a bother just now, he wouldn't be...

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:08.310
Don't worry about me and fight back!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:09.810
You're strong, right?

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:14.230
You can't lose to guys that fight only using cowardly tricks!

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:17.150
Don't worry about me!

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.480
Is it really okay saying something like that?

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:22.570
Oh, I see. You just want everyone to see more of your pan-

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.910
How did you untie yourself?

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:27.280
This?

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.450
The knot was loose from the beginning...

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:32.660
I didn't have to courage to run away on my own, so I just pretended that I couldn't move.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:35.250
Your knots were too loose!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.710
But you guys told me to tie it that way...

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:39.460
Don't blame it on other people!

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:43.220
Now, time for some payback.

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:44.220
Shit.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.600
Get them!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.320
Are you all right?

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:09.370
Yeah.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:11.580
I was really...

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:16.000
...scared!

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:26.260
She took him down...

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:28.510
Even though no one's won against him until now...

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:32.520
Only Misao's chick would have such power...

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:34.980
Then the strongest one is...

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:36.270
...this girl?

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.650
We worship you!

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.530
What?

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:43.240
I saw them...

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.490
Ayumi-chan's panties...

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:12.010
My love life has just started.

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:49.490
My first love has just begun...

00:23:49.740 --> 00:23:51.610
And yet there's already trouble!

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.370
Zaitsu-kun, no!

00:23:54.370 --> 00:23:58.660
Don't succumb to that boob woman's temptations!
